<title>GERMANY: M&amp;M opens Moscow airfreight office.</title>
<headline>M&amp;M opens Moscow airfreight office.</headline>
<dateline>FRANKFURT 1997-04-22</dateline>
<text>
<p>German freight forwarder M&amp;M Militzer &amp; Muench GmbH said it has opened a Moscow office for international airfreight services.</p>
<p>M&amp;M Air Cargo Service will operate the office at Sheremetyevo I airport, a company statement said. --Reuters Air Cargo Newsroom. Tel +44 171 542 7706; Fax: 5017</p>
